        "text": "<thinking> To handle partial and final streaming recognition events, I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API, which is a concrete external provider. I will create the file `partial_results.py` in the current working directory and include the necessary imports and code to interact with the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. </thinking>\n",
